    {
      "t": "00:00",
      "en": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:05",
      "en": "Hello, Assalamu Alaikum."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:07",
      "en": "Hello, how are you?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:10",
      "en": "I am from Kozhikode. Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:12",
      "en": "I am from Kattappana."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:15",
      "en": "Oh, what do you do?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:18",
      "en": "I work. I work in a hospital."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:21",
      "en": "Is that so?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:26",
      "en": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:28",
      "en": "Are you on the app for a long time?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:30",
      "en": "No, not for long. Just a month or so. Sometimes I come here, just like this, I am bored."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:35",
      "en": "Okay, okay. Are you a friend?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:37",
      "en": "No, I don't come here often."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:40",
      "en": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:42",
      "en": "Where are you calling from?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:45",
      "en": "From my home, somewhere."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:47",
      "en": "Oh, you are at home?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:50",
      "en": "Yes, what else?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:54",
      "en": "Are you at home now?"
    },
    {
      "t": "00:57",
      "en": "Yes, I am at home."
    },
    {
      "t": "00:59",
      "en": "Who else is there?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:01",
      "en": "At home, there are children, and I am there."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:05",
      "en": "Are you married?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:07",
      "en": "Yes, I am."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:10",
      "en": "My husband has gone to work."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:13",
      "en": "What about the children?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:15",
      "en": "The children are asleep. I had some work, so I am just sitting here after finishing it."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:20",
      "en": "Oh, I see."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:23",
      "en": "I haven't slept yet, so I just logged in. I need to sleep. I have duty in the morning."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:28",
      "en": "I will sleep and wake up, I will go to sleep when I feel like it."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:33",
      "en": "I had some writing to do. Once that was done, I came here."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:38",
      "en": "Did you find any friends?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:40",
      "en": "No, just a few."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:43",
      "en": "Isn't it ten months since you joined?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:46",
      "en": "No, it's just one month. It's been a month."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:49",
      "en": "Oh, one month. I see."
    },
    {
      "t": "01:53",
      "en": "Did you find any friends?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:54",
      "en": "How?"
    },
    {
      "t": "01:57",
      "en": "Why are you chewing betel leaves?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:00",
      "en": "No, I am not."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:05",
      "en": "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:07",
      "en": "Are you chewing betel leaves at night?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:09",
      "en": "No, I am not."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:11",
      "en": "Then?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:13",
      "en": "What is your job?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:16",
      "en": "I am an accountant."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:20",
      "en": "Are you free tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:23",
      "en": "Yes, I am free. I can go."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:26",
      "en": "Then, have you eaten?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:30",
      "en": "Yes, I have eaten and I am lying down. I will go to sleep now."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:33",
      "en": "You finished your sleep, right?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:35",
      "en": "Yes, I finished my sleep."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:40",
      "en": "Tell me."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:43",
      "en": "Tell me, did you find any friends?"
    },
    {
      "t": "02:49",
      "en": "No, I don't know how to find friends."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:53",
      "en": "I just talk, that's all."
    },
    {
      "t": "02:57",
      "en": "Is this your first call?"
    },
    {
      "t": "03:00",
      "en": "Yes, this is my first call."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:04",
      "en": "What do you usually talk about?"
    },
    {
      "t": "03:07",
      "en": "What is there to talk about? We just talk about everything."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:14",
      "en": "What do you talk about?"
    },
    {
      "t": "03:16",
      "en": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "t": "03:18",
      "en": "What do you talk about?"
    },
    {
      "t": "03:20",
      "en": "I like it. It's not like that, I just talk."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:25",
      "en": "Some people ask if it's a normal call or an open talk, things like that."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:31",
      "en": "We sometimes talk about our mood. I have never done an open talk."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:37",
      "en": "I just talk, I talk in a friendly way."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:42",
      "en": "Have you never done an open talk?"
    },
    {
      "t": "03:45",
      "en": "I haven't done an open talk. I have heard people talking about it, like couples and all that."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:55",
      "en": "I have heard about it."
    },
    {
      "t": "03:59",
      "en": "Nothing else."
    },
    {
      "t": "04:02",
      "en": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "t": "04:05",
      "en": "Then?"
    },
    {
      "t": "04:07",
      "en": "Tell me."
    },
    {
      "t": "04:09",
      "en": "Now, there are people who come after finishing their duty, people from outside."
    },
    {
      "t": "04:15",
      "en": "I like talking to such people."
    },
    {
      "t": "04:18",
      "en": "Is that so?"
    }
